      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that integrates with a concrete external provider for email and password login. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Firebase Authentication service for this task, as it is a well-known provider for user authentication. </thinking>\n",
